      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MICK THE MASTER (7) is better than last start when fifth (19.91) in a Mix 1/2/3 at this track over 340m. Has a strong winning record at this journey. Goes very well from this draw with eight wins and two minor placings from 18 starts. Tough to beat if on-song. ROYMAN (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 6th and beaten 10 lengths at this track (20.36). Goes very well at course and distance boasting 16 wins. The form out of last race has been strong. Expected to feature in the finish. LEVINGS (4) stalked the lead from a low draw and fought on well to finish 2.5 lengths back in third (20.16) at this track in a Mix 3/4 over 340m. Must be included in calculations. MARVELLOUS MEL (1) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
